    "name": "p-OCV hold",
    "kind": "quasi_ocv",
    "description": "Pseudo-OCV with voltage hold: constant-current cycling at C/50. The voltage is held for 6 h under potentiostatic control upon reaching the upper and lower voltage cutoffs. 5 cycles, room temperature.",
